  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Media Viability Fund. Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r ett antal medief&#xf6;retag i dessa l&#xe4;nder att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sin kapacitet att bli uth&#xe5;lliga f&#xf6;retag p&#xe5; marknadsm&#xe4;ssiga villkor. MVF &#xe4;r ett gemensamt projekt f&#xf6;r Media Development Loan Fund och Eurasia Foundation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media Viability Fund. The overall objective is to make independent media organizations in the former soviet Union financially viable by offering loans, technical assistance and training by expert advisors. The Media Viability Fund is a cooperation between Media Development Loan Fund and the Eurasia Foundation.</narrative>
